      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e3f15a5a_6ef6cdee",
        "filename": "drivers/of/platform.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 208,
      "author": {
        "id": 1446383
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-05-21T18:56:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t remember ever seeing atomic pointers. AFAIK, that\u0027s not a thing, but I could be wrong. 32-bit read/writes on ARM are sometimes assumed (guaranteed?) to be atomic but I don\u0027t think 64-bit read/writes are.\n\nAlso, even if that\u0027s possible, I still need this spinlock for get_device() to work safely inside of_find_device_by_node(). That way the dev doesn\u0027t get freed after the NULL check inside get_device().",
      "parentUuid": "e8977e55_774882ee",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 206,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 208,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "e43ba023452692e322cf38f022b467757f12997c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c9c28633_88f9557d",
        "filename": "drivers/of/platform.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 208,
      "author": {
        "id": 1032276
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-05-21T19:57:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here, however, you can write safely atomically, you do not have that race. (But you might introduce a maintenance issue).\n\nThe odds are _zero_ you would be calling this function and the lock contends as this is called in the probe/init routines right?\n\nREAD_ONCE() and WRITE_ONCE() are the defacto atomic pointer ops.\n\nHowever, if you expand the locks a bit (line 60-66), you could set np-\u003edev with the result of to_platform_device(bus_find_device(...)) so that the second lookup is faster. Do we expect of_find_device_by_node to be called multiple times after a relationship is established?",
      "parentUuid": "e3f15a5a_6ef6cdee",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 206,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 208,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "e43ba023452692e322cf38f022b467757f12997c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
