      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-05-22T15:50:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So once I get the lock inside of_find_device_by_node(), I prevent this execution flow from continuing till I grab a reference with get_device().\n\nAnd once I get the reference, it\u0027s okay for this to continue as I now have a reference and the memory itself can\u0027t be freed.",
